  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Womiengnonon Rice Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unit for processing paddy rice into milled rice will allow the cooperative and producers to earn additional income.The storage warehouse will allow better storage of the products in order to better sell them.Tractors and accessory equipment for sowing and harvesting will mechanize and facilitate the work of producers. This will allow them to produce in large quantities and earn more money..Agricultural inputs and training on the technical route of rice will help improve yields and incomes for producers.Transport vehicles will reduce vehicle rental costs. Thus the cooperative will earn more money and can increase the price of paddy rice to producers.</narrative>
  </description>
